WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,220
This brother

2
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,480
I am a new recruit in the army

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:06,160
Where is the convoy going to Huangsha Town Daying?

4
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:09,420
Are you assigned to the Huangsha Town Camp?

5
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,620
Recruits from Huangsha Town Camp

6
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,340
Is there any problem? You said go there?

7
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,300
The convoy from the Huangsha Town camp is not available here.

8
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:20,480
Because it’s relatively remote and the terrain there is really, really complicated.

9
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:22,980
Then what should I do?

10
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,100
Go to Huangsha Town Daying

11
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:27,310
You can understand by riding a horse on your own

12
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:29,750
What an unlucky guy to be assigned to

13
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:30,670
Huangsha Town Daying

14
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,350
You don’t know who you offended

15
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:38,150
When I first came to Yunqicheng, no one left me alone.

16
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:40,950
How could I offend anyone?

17
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:43,110
Let’s ask about the guests first

18
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:44,630
Come to you this time

19
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:47,070
I'm asking you about a place.

20
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,400
Have you heard of Huangsha Town Camp?

21
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:51,970
Of course I've heard of it

22
00:00:52,330 --> 00:01:08,540
Is the legendary Thorny Head Camp? Thorny Head Camp?

23
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:11,810
Please tell me carefully
